sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler as Background Scheduler
    participant ExpiryJob as Expiry Job
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Log as Application Log

    Note over Scheduler: Scheduled task runs daily<br/>at randomized time 03:45–05:45 local time<br/>(load spreading across EU gates)

    Scheduler->>+ExpiryJob: triggerExpiryJob()

    ExpiryJob->>+DB: SELECT datasetId FROM consignments<br/>WHERE deliveredAt IS NULL<br/>AND createdAt < NOW() - INTERVAL '90 days'
    Note over DB: Query uses idx_consignments_expires_at<br/>Partial index on deliveredAt IS NULL
    DB-->>-ExpiryJob: [550e8400-..., a1b2c3d4-..., c3d4e5f6-...]

    loop For each expired consignment
        ExpiryJob->>+DB: UPDATE consignments<br/>SET deliveredAt = NOW()<br/>WHERE datasetId = '550e8400-...'
        DB-->>-ExpiryJob: 1 row updated

        ExpiryJob->>Log: INFO: Expired consignment 550e8400-... (platformId=demo)
    end

    ExpiryJob->>Log: INFO: Expiry job complete. Expired 3 consignments.
    ExpiryJob-->>-Scheduler: done

    Note over Scheduler: Next run scheduled for tomorrow<br/>at randomized time 03:45–05:45
